  {
   "text": "The smooth trace of [def-pur-smooth-trace] and the composition and\nbase-change coherence statements over $E$ and $\\Qlb$ – those of\n[thm-pur-composition-coherence] and\n[thm-pur-smooth-base-change-coherence] – are the $E$-\nand $\\Qlb$-reductions of the corresponding $\\mathcal O_E$-level\nstatements of [thm-pur-adic-reconstruction] and [prop-pur-adic-reconstruction-trace-coherence], transported along\nthe same exact functors and restricted to the direct summands (the\ntrace of a summand is the summand of the trace, by naturality).",
